  "description": "The goblin Lee Mae, who lived peacefully in the mountains, has his life completely changed by two women. He has never loved or hated anyone this much before! A spirited girl, a mischievous fox, and a cruel but pure goblin. Whether the relationship between the three is good or bad, one thing is certain. It will end only when one of them dies! A lyrical romance drama that alternates between joy and sorrow.\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
